s+=section(heading('Learning is part of the process','A Better Question Can Be<br>a Useful First Step.','Where does work wait? What keeps coming back to you? What information does the next person need? You do not have to solve everything at once.')+cards([('Notice','Start with a real example from your business, rather than a solution you think you should buy.'),('Understand','Look at who does the work, what supports it, and how it moves between people.'),('Try and Learn','Choose one useful change. Observe what happens and use it to decide what deserves attention next.')]))
